      "blurb": "Salarian research operative with field-deployed chemical arsenal",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Salarian scientists deployed in field conditions are not passive observers. They carry the chemical agents they've developed, use their analytical biology to identify weaknesses in hostile organisms, and process tactical information faster than most species can complete a thought. They are not soldiers, but they are considerably more dangerous than they appear.</p><p><strong>Chemical Analysis:</strong> Can identify substances, poisons, and biology by scent/contact. Automatically detects poisoned substances before ingesting.</p><p><strong>Accelerated Mind:</strong> +2 to initiative.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
